You don't understand how prayer and sacrafice interact so you
have an unrealistic expectation about getting artifacts.  The chance
of getting an artifact *starts* when you start seeing clovers (actually
when you feel reconciled but early on the two tend to go together).
Do even one prayer and it takes far longer before yoy see the first
one because it resets your prayer timeout.  Sacs go against
prayer timeout or anger first and both have to hit zero before there
is any chance whatsoever of getting an artifact.

The strategy to get artifacts is to never pray at all when it can be
avoided.

